      "name": "Ibrahim H.",
      "created_at": "2025-10-19T12:50:58.492Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hello all,</p>\n<p>I am new to ERPNext and this forum and I am currently experimenting with ERPNext locally.</p>\n<p>At the moment I have just setup email, so ERPNext is able to send mail from the application. The challenge I am having now is that the link in the email, for resetting passwords for example, is not correct. Does anybody know how I can change this? I will be happy to hear from you and thanks in advance.</p>",
