      "username": "volkswagner",
      "name": "volkswagner",
      "created_at": "2025-10-19T12:54:50.623Z",
      "cooked": "<p>In your site_config.json you can add:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-auto\"> \"hostname\": \"https://erp.yourdomain.com\",\n</code></pre>",
